  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I would like to suggest that there should be a way for us to create completely different hand gestures when making avatars so that it makes some custom overrides more fluid with valve index controllers. This is so that we can change one of the overrides to react when only the middle finger is extended or when only the index finger and the thumb are touching the controller. Or we could make it so that the override toggle actually makes is so that the thumbstick acts like the htc vive trackpad(movement may just be controlled by pressing down the thumbstick or trigger). Just some ideas.",
